  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper studies a Wasserstein quantum generative adversarial network (QGAN) with a parameterized quantum circuit generator for financial time-series generation. Experiments use simulated circuits of 10 qubits and 8–18 layers and an MPS simulation up to 20 qubits (bond dimension 70) to generate S&P 500 log‑return windows of length 20–40, showing qualitative reproduction of stylized facts such as volatility clustering but without demonstrating computational advantage over classical methods.",
